  "releaseNotes": "**Fixed:**\n\n            - `RegisteredViewFor` now works properly when passing a ViewModel cast to one of its\n               base types, e.g. `IMyViewModel` or `INotifyPropertyChanged`\n\n            **Breaking Changes:**\n\n            - The source generator for `ViewModelFor` now generates a class *in the namespace of the\n              project* that is using the `ViewModelFor` attribute instead of in `Dmnk.Blazor.Mvvm`.\n              This fixes usage in multiple projects.",
